# Katara, Water Tribe's Hope (3/3 Ally, vigilance): "When Katara enters, create a 1/1 white Ally creature token." and "Waterbend {X}: Creatures you
# control have base power and toughness X/X until end of turn. X can't be 0. Activate only during your turn." (CR 701.67, 613.4b, 611.2c, 107.3a).
# Turn 1 Bot1 casts Katara with Mox Pearl, Mox Sapphire and Black Lotus, getting the 1/1 Ally token, and a Memnite and Ornithopter. It cannot
# activate on Bot2's turn 2. On turn 3, with X 2 paid by tapping Memnite and Ornithopter, its creatures are 2/2 - Katara shrinks to
# 2/2, the token and Memnite grow, Bot2's Memnite stays 1/1 and the Phyrexian Walker cast afterwards stays 0/3 - and the effect wears off on turn 4.

